1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,294
B, ethoxyethane, diethyl ether.

2
00:00:03,294 --> 00:00:09,479
At one forty degrees two ethanol molecules lose one water between them.

3
00:00:09,479 --> 00:00:15,625
At one seventy degrees, each molecule loses its own water, giving ethene.

4
00:00:15,625 --> 00:00:18,359
Ethanal needs an oxidising agent.

